		context:
			'---\nname: updatePermission\ndescription: Updates a permission on a file or shared drive.\n---\n\n# Update Permission\n\nUpdates an existing permission on a file or shared drive using `PATCH /files/{fileId}/permissions/{permissionId}`.\n\n## Recommended Workflow\n\n1. Use the `arbitraryCall` endpoint with `GET /files/{fileId}/permissions` (or `GET /files/{fileId}/permissions/{permissionId}`) to retrieve the current permission state.\n2. Modify the desired fields.\n3. Call this endpoint to apply changes.\n\n## Key Behavior\n\n- Only the fields provided in the request body are updated; other fields remain unchanged.\n- To transfer ownership, set `role` to `owner` and `transferOwnership` to `true`.\n- Expiration times cannot be set on shared drive permissions.\n- The `view` field can be set to `published` for published content.\n\n## Shared Drive Support\n\nShared drive support is always enabled (`supportsAllDrives` is hardcoded to `true`).\n\n## Response\n\nReturns the updated Permission resource.\n',
